    cof:title "35 Subsections 26A(4), (5), (6) and (7)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (4) A declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the declaration. That day must not be a day before the declaration is made.  (5) A revocation of a declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes effect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of revocation. That day must not be a day before the instrument is made." ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

