    skos:prefLabel "42 Subsection 26C(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) If a system has been determined under this section, the Minister may use that system for the purposes of deciding what eligible person should be declared under subsection 26A(1) in a particular situation, or may make that decision on some other basis." ;
