    cof:title "16 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(No. 1) 2000       No. 95, 2000 the ACA must, in dealing with the notice, comply with this section within 75 days after the end of that financial year." ;
