concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-68 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68 Before paragraph 57(1)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-68 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (aa) if a determination under subsection (1A) covering the person and that financial year has effect for the person and the financial year—the person’s net universal service cost for the financial year is:  (i) if the determination specifies an amount as the person’s net universal service cost for the financial year—that amount; or  (ii) if the determination specifies a method for working out the person’s net universal cost for the financial year— the amount worked out in accordance with the determination;" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (aa) if a determination under subsection (1A) covering the person and that financial year has effect for the person and the financial year—the person’s net universal service cost for the financial year is:  (i) if the determination specifies an amount as the person’s net universal service cost for the financial year—that amount; or  (ii) if the determination specifies a method for working out the person’s net universal cost for the financial year— the amount worked out in accordance with the determination;"@en ;
