concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-70-ss-1e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(1E) After subsection 57(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-70-ss-1e ;
    values:originalText "(1E) If a determination under subsection (1A) is varied or revoked, the following paragraphs apply:  (a) in the case of a variation:  (i) the variation has effect, for the year or each of the years to which it purports to apply, whether it was made before or during the year, or (subject to subparagraph (ii)) after the end of the year; but  (ii) it does not have effect for a year and a particular person if it was made after the making of an assessment under section 64 covering the financial year and the person; and  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime" ;
    skos:definition "(1E) If a determination under subsection (1A) is varied or revoked, the following paragraphs apply:  (a) in the case of a variation:  (i) the variation has effect, for the year or each of the years to which it purports to apply, whether it was made before or during the year, or (subject to subparagraph (ii)) after the end of the year; but  (ii) it does not have effect for a year and a particular person if it was made after the making of an assessment under section 64 covering the financial year and the person; and  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4488e97859465ec54c66c5fd9a1791ff261beae6cd5117d17d8f46ebc235a255" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-70 ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Variation of determination under subsection (1A) has effect for the year or each of the years to which it purports to apply." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
