concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-85 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85 New section 61AA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-85 ;
    values:originalText "Section 61AA of the amended Act applies in relation to the financial year in which the commencement occurs and later financial years.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 10 May 2000 Senate on 22 June 2000]  (83/00)" ;
